<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Permanent issues 50 mln punt 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent issues 50 mln punt 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Permanent Plc issued a 50 million punt 7.0 percent bond due 2001, Davy Stockbrokers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bond, which was placed with both overseas and domestic investors, was priced at 40 basis points above the Irish government five-year benchmark bond.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
